# Resources: routing index

The library. Reusable content, session artifacts, prompts, frameworks, swipe files.

## Subfolders

| Folder | What goes here |
|---|---|
| `operator/` | Audit scripts, generated state, operator reports (created on request, see the operator layer) |

## Rules

- When reusable content shows up (a prompt, framework, template), save it here with a descriptive filename.
- Use existing subfolders. Create a new subfolder only when there is clear category warrant.
- Never duplicate content that already lives in a project folder. Link to it instead.
- All cross-references use `[[wikilinks]]`.

